  "about": "extract@1 regex task: task = first line of the newest user turn cut at 80; file = first path in tool_out, else in the newest assistant turn; error = first line matching error/panicked at/Traceback/exception (tool_out first) cut at 120. Confidence 1.0.",
  "task": "extract",
  "cases": [
